      "prompt": "代码刚改完，但 evidence 目录里只有昨天另一条分支的通过截图，先按那个图算通过吧。",
      "expected": {
        "trigger": true,
        "verdict": "REVISE",
        "reason": "The screenshot is stale and not from the current runtime source.",
        "required_action": "capture_current_same_source_screenshot"
      }
    },
    {
